<!-- 10. TRANSPARENCY & INTEGRITY SECTION -->
<section class="w-full py-14 sm:py-24 bg-surface-container">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mb-8 sm:mb-16">
      <span class="font-label text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] uppercase font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] sm:tracking-[0.22em] text-primary block mb-2">
        Structural Integrity
      </span>
      <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-on-surface tracking-tight">
        No Guesswork. No Surprises.
      </h2>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
      <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 sm:w-12 sm:h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-on-primary-fixed mb-4 sm:mb-6">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] sm:text-[24px]">description</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2">1. Clear Specifications</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Every grade of cement, structural rebar, acoustic double glazing, and conduit line is defined upfront before ground breaking.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 sm:w-12 sm:h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-on-primary-fixed mb-4 sm:mb-6">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] sm:text-[24px]">flag</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2">2. Project Milestones</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Critical Path Method (CPM) scheduling ensures every dependency is mapped, tracked, and delivered strictly on time.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 sm:w-12 sm:h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-on-primary-fixed mb-4 sm:mb-6">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] sm:text-[24px]">category</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2">3. Material Selection</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Physical material mockups, batch certifications, and curated European samples approved before procurement begins.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 sm:w-12 sm:h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-on-primary-fixed mb-4 sm:mb-6">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] sm:text-[24px]">fact_check</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2">4. Quality Checks</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Rigorous ultrasonic weld testing, concrete cube compression checks, and laser plumb line alignments at every stage.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 sm:w-12 sm:h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-on-primary-fixed mb-4 sm:mb-6">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] sm:text-[24px]">cloud_sync</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2">5. Project Updates</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Weekly cloud reports featuring high-definition aerial drone photography, structural milestones, and schedule health.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 sm:w-12 sm:h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-on-primary-fixed mb-4 sm:mb-6">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] sm:text-[24px]">payments</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2">6. Structured Payments</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Protected escrow mechanisms and stage-gated release gates ensure capital safety and absolute transparency throughout.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
